{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "a6beb20da19559ebf8e067a909e5b096a34c2758a620381a298bd38e06860b05", "ja": "近未来へ", "zh": "前往近未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c61a92fd4817bdabe66bce8e5f052a5cff6fcf48ac3bff84f6da0bf402852c53", "ja": "新作映画のスチル撮影のため、ロケ地にやっ\nてきたアイドル達。本当に作品の世界に入り\n込んでしまったかのようなセットに、胸の高\n鳴りを覚えている様子。張り切る一同に、プ\nロデューサーの期待も高まるのだった。", "zh": "为了拍摄新电影的剧照，偶像们来到了外景地。\n置身于仿佛真的进入了作品世界一般的布景中，\n她们似乎都感到心潮澎湃。看着干劲十足的众人，\n制作人的期待也越来越高了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "585378fa285238064860e95ae4cbc27ad8c76e68c697136817f249ce3947ce0a", "ja": "（今日は新作映画のスチル撮影だ。ロケ地に、\nセットを建てて背景にしているそうだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新电影的剧照。听说在取景地搭建了布景作为背景，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "84de0889317dc95c136a789676278aa94479fb64952aa5bf832cfb99e650e7f8", "ja": "お邪魔いたしま……わぁ……！", "zh": "打扰了……哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6985e8090545ae6a8bc21c6f198021ab308f7b9a18a086f0174fff77cb982f32", "ja": "これはすごいな！　本当に、作品の世界に\n入り込んでしまったみたいだ……。", "zh": "这真是太厉害了！简直就像真的进入了作品的世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "ca7e052fae43b5e918286b647e746ad46f84d44f960b15a16ad0e9464f3f3388", "ja": "はい。私も、舞台機構だと聞いていたので……\nまさか、こんなに本格的だとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "是的。我之前也听说这是舞台机关……没想到居然会这么逼真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "79a99ea9b9db418df09d1faa47b7e074672b940bb0e76dd03ca3b3acb456341f", "ja": "これが、近未来外様の世界なのですね……！", "zh": "这就是近未来外来者的世界啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "834aa29e33c78deb1398aa58802d9544f90b4ff6cc53bcddd8d93f1254eaa51b", "ja": "近未来……えっ？\nいや、外様はちょっと違うような……。", "zh": "近未来……诶？\n不对，外样这个词好像不太合适……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "1835619e480c3b8b5e86cfb65f08c592a4dbfd7df4bd0a3140d706d01edb1b3f", "ja": "あ……では、近未来……無法者？\nいえ、部外者でしょうか。それとも、異分子……。", "zh": "啊……那么，近未来……无赖之徒？\n不，应该是局外人吧。还是说，异类……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6058cc6994ec551c97d15d84b204328c5f8d9a4ff626ca94cd2578a11cbabdc9", "ja": "部外者もなんだしな……無法者は近いけど。\n異分子の方が、SF感があってカッコイイかもな。", "zh": "叫局外人也不太合适……无法之徒倒是比较接近。不过，异分子听起来更有科幻感，也许更帅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "64c61a78951abc295e974c7216bbac25ee36bd6b83372c1a21f2f15e0ab6ca34", "ja": "では、近未来異分子ですね！　撮影が始まるのが、\nますます楽しみになって参りました♪", "zh": "那么，就是近未来的异分子呢！越发期待拍摄开始了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "ffa73e666d0d42121b27fbdddf7545dba65dd8542ef1a11a3896229488859f49", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんとエミリーちゃん！\nふたりとも、もう来てたんですね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生和艾米莉！  \n你们两个已经到了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "ec23e8603f55a308a7a412ee41babb887eb35a0deb88f4fe4b5d3ad5cd92f9f3", "ja": "本当だ！　お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}。エミリーも！", "zh": "真的！辛苦了，{$P$}。艾米莉也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "e435f3b5c56ae6176bfcd76e531d41e8aacca1ab989d3a47a4aa962c0f1a30a9", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "两位都辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "4bd3c28305765b957a7310a8401996801a396db50f62b06aa8cf63260e55934d", "ja": "春香さん！　それに真さま、千早さんも！\nみなさん、早かったんですね。", "zh": "春香！还有真大人、千早！\n大家来得好早呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "6716c1476869216f55b36ac3c77e412e60696e079f034b139fb5648a1f68cf2c", "ja": "私たち、お仕事が早く終わっちゃって。\nそれでちょっと早めに来ただけなんだ。", "zh": "我们工作提前结束了。\n所以就稍微早点过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "3a7509b18e100b42aa1e0d3b59412721a2ff8e22ccf88568465934cb1b5ef9ef", "ja": "そうそう。外で時間潰すのもなんだし、\nせっかくだから、みんなでセットを見学しようって！", "zh": "对对。在外面消磨时间也不太好，难得有这个机会，就想着大家一起参观一下布景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c410f8557d1d44727ab33b33ec4eaf8943ffbd4b4ce680916ec7d61f50d2beba", "ja": "なんだ、そうだったのか。それじゃ、\nスタッフさんに見学人数が増えたって知らせてくるよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那我去告诉工作人员，参观的人数增加了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "aea2a57b3a22b72e1a9b3727ce44b1200d5e3f472a2602ca1d804896b836d7b5", "ja": "それにしても、すごいな～！\n本当に、近未来の世界に迷い込んだみたいだ！", "zh": "不过话说回来，真厉害啊～！\n真的，就像误闯进了近未来的世界一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "52ab8a3b378e548e0427061707bc7868855c04f8d7a7873e44060352f5de25b9", "ja": "真、わかってると思うけど、今日は……。", "zh": "真，我想你应该明白，今天是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "5d2b2bc3a3740181995431803356a496ecfd59de72203e4ab201a31425b942a6", "ja": "仕事ですよね、もちろんわかってますよ♪　でも\n見てくださいよ、この景色！　ワクワクしませんか！？", "zh": "是工作嘛，当然知道啦♪ 不过\n快看这景色！不觉得很让人兴奋吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "7f900e9376cd16607e4b6765090d5f545ae20852acd4685da989452922f3ccb6", "ja": "私もです、真さま！\nそういえば、美希さんは別のお仕事なんですか？", "zh": "我也是，真大人！说起来，美希是在做别的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "4078d8ee03351bea44e9810afdb9e1a5a6116b2ad43d392a833836dbb2d5de40", "ja": "あっ、ウワサをすれば……。\n美希～、こっちだよ！", "zh": "啊，说到她她就来了……美希～，这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "f32dd8f37bc54543319f6fcbea9219041fae8ae480e04b20f968e4b412326f84", "ja": "お疲れさま、美希！　今日は早いんだね。", "zh": "辛苦了，美希！今天来得真早啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "01ebc574fcb44b403a259e21c43b23eb8bc83e9f985b7201a87c1894b55a3941", "ja": "ミキ、別に早くないよ？\nだって……。", "zh": "我才不算早呢？\n因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1024_staff", "source_sha256": "d71ac4f318322e458b95a1f42f4cac39e70b322e78fecb9542d6590ef7feb290", "ja": "765プロのみなさん、メイク室の準備が整いました！\n可能な方からお願いしまーす！", "zh": "765事务所的各位，化妆室已经准备好了！\n请准备好的人按顺序过来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8f046c577642e71d6e66d06cdf9b85556c40932923cfa5ad4b83340fc76a15e5", "ja": "はい、すぐ行きます！　……セットを見学\nしていただけで、結構、時間が経ってたみたいだな。", "zh": "好的，我马上过去！……光是在参观布景，竟然就已经过了不少时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "b27c4dc72d32f4737e3e39acde3e41c47fde82f88450d48947a14a2d630fa875", "ja": "本当ですね。\nみんな、急いでメイクしてもらわないと！", "zh": "确实呢。\n大家得赶紧去化妆才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "592c11a77ec9bbb70a3431aa854afcae6d638b81280e521d7b1d4840429271f9", "ja": "ミキ、今からバスターブレイドに変身なの～☆\nえいえいっ。", "zh": "美希现在要变身成破坏者之刃啦～☆\n嘿咻嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "72dc97e30b814a0e826dc7d7048413cb9394482297c47d368a2cbaa720d54af5", "ja": "あはは！　ボクだって負けないぞ！\n最高にカッコイイ、ベルベットに変身するよ！", "zh": "哈哈！我也不会输的！\n我要变身成超帅气的贝尔贝特！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "8f0d93869e24828af37667c08c2f5d17ff6584acb7aeb9976cbdedfc53792dac", "ja": "千早さんも、身支度部屋に行かれますよね？", "zh": "千早也要去准备室，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "34092d7649bb099b0a6efa0bce482d62653c04db2b54cd1ceb094d3c91ef25ec", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\n私もダスクのメイクをしてもらわないと……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n我也得去让人帮我化达斯克的妆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "c7bf8abc42852da69b094fde22078b85ea375f00982d01745da9b9c4bad31297", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}さん、\n行ってきますね！", "zh": "那么{$P$}先生，我先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5118d34a3efee223baf9df5cafefbbd2252db5818da9a3674bbb7282fbe4afdb", "ja": "ああ、気をつけてな！", "zh": "啊，路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ecce02035bbf53dbb3dbe242b21582e06d5fa792823eb58a98f639aa5c581cca", "ja": "（まだスチル撮影の段階なのに、みんな随分張り切って\nいるみたいだ。これはきっと、いい映画になるぞ！）", "zh": "（明明还只是拍摄剧照的阶段，大家好像就已经干劲十足了。这样一来，一定能拍出一部好电影！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
